  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "sectionId": "kaigo-atomic-standing-cane",
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "knowledgePointJa": "立ち上がる前に体調とできる動作を確認し、行うことを説明して同意を得ます。資料の片麻痺の例では、座る位置をやや浅くし、健側の足を後方へ引き、上体を前へ傾けて立ち上がりにつなげています。重心を支えのある範囲へ移し、健側に重さをかけやすくする考え方です。",
      "evidenceType": "source_concept_independent_expression_with_conditions",
      "source": {
        "document": "介護ー特定技能ーベトナム語.pdf",
        "edition": "second revision March 2025",
        "sha256": "997bf386ba8344e19c644c3cbd6ae2d40760bfb32ed882db999ad8e17068aa54"
      },
      "printedPages": [
        129,
        132,
        133,
        134,
        135
      ],
      "pdfPages": [
        131,
        134,
        135,
        136,
        137
      ],
      "pageMappingStatus": "printed_labels_text_and_selected_rendered_pages_checked",
      "corroboratingSourceIds": [],
      "verificationStatus": "ai_source_comparison_only",
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "domainReviewed": false,
      "nativeReviewed": false
    },
    {
      "sectionId": "kaigo-atomic-standing-cane",
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "knowledgePointJa": "この例では介護職員が患側に位置し、患側の膝折れと転倒を防ぐための支えを行います。膝折れは、立位や歩行中に膝で身体を支えられず曲がってしまうことです。身体や頭の位置を大きく変えた後は、めまいや気分、体調の変化を確かめます。",
      "evidenceType": "source_concept_independent_expression_with_conditions",
      "source": {
        "document": "介護ー特定技能ーベトナム語.pdf",
        "edition": "second revision March 2025",
        "sha256": "997bf386ba8344e19c644c3cbd6ae2d40760bfb32ed882db999ad8e17068aa54"
      },
      "printedPages": [
        129,
        132,
        133,
        134,
        135
      ],
      "pdfPages": [
        131,
        134,
        135,
        136,
        137
      ],
      "pageMappingStatus": "printed_labels_text_and_selected_rendered_pages_checked",
      "corroboratingSourceIds": [],
      "verificationStatus": "ai_source_comparison_only",
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "domainReviewed": false,
      "nativeReviewed": false
    },
    {
      "sectionId": "kaigo-atomic-standing-cane",
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "knowledgePointJa": "杖による三動作歩行は「杖、患側の足、健側の足」を分けて進める例です。二動作歩行では「杖と患側の足、次に健側の足」とまとめます。資料は三動作の方を安定性が高い例として示していますが、本人の力や用具、実際の歩行を評価せず、速さだけで動作数を変えません。",
      "evidenceType": "source_concept_independent_expression_with_conditions",
      "source": {
        "document": "介護ー特定技能ーベトナム語.pdf",
        "edition": "second revision March 2025",
        "sha256": "997bf386ba8344e19c644c3cbd6ae2d40760bfb32ed882db999ad8e17068aa54"
      },
      "printedPages": [
        129,
        132,
        133,
        134,
        135
      ],
      "pdfPages": [
        131,
        134,
        135,
        136,
        137
      ],
      "pageMappingStatus": "printed_labels_text_and_selected_rendered_pages_checked",
      "corroboratingSourceIds": [],
      "verificationStatus": "ai_source_comparison_only",
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "domainReviewed": false,
      "nativeReviewed": false
    },
    {
      "sectionId": "kaigo-atomic-standing-cane",
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "knowledgePointJa": "片麻痺の歩行介助の例では、介護職員は患側の後方に位置し、必要に応じて上体や腰を支えます。患側の足から進める例は、歩き始めに健側で身体を支えるという理由と対応させます。具体的な支え方や介助量は個別の計画と実技訓練に従います。",
      "evidenceType": "source_concept_independent_expression_with_conditions",
      "source": {
        "document": "介護ー特定技能ーベトナム語.pdf",
        "edition": "second revision March 2025",
        "sha256": "997bf386ba8344e19c644c3cbd6ae2d40760bfb32ed882db999ad8e17068aa54"
      },
      "printedPages": [
        129,
        132,
        133,
        134,
        135
      ],
      "pdfPages": [
        131,
        134,
        135,
        136,
        137
      ],
      "pageMappingStatus": "printed_labels_text_and_selected_rendered_pages_checked",
      "corroboratingSourceIds": [],
      "verificationStatus": "ai_source_comparison_only",
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "domainReviewed": false,
      "nativeReviewed": false
    },
    {
      "sectionId": "kaigo-atomic-standing-cane",
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "knowledgePointJa": "段差を上がる例の順序は「杖、健側の足、患側の足」、下りる例は「杖、患側の足、健側の足」です。介護職員は本人より低い段に位置し、上がるときは後ろ側、下りるときは前側となる例が示されています。資料の一段下という配置は、その図の条件での説明です。手すり、段差、使う杖、本人の能力によって方法を確認します。",
      "evidenceType": "source_concept_independent_expression_with_conditions",
      "source": {
        "document": "介護ー特定技能ーベトナム語.pdf",
        "edition": "second revision March 2025",
        "sha256": "997bf386ba8344e19c644c3cbd6ae2d40760bfb32ed882db999ad8e17068aa54"
      },
      "printedPages": [
        129,
        132,
        133,
        134,
        135
      ],
      "pdfPages": [
        131,
        134,
        135,
        136,
        137
      ],
      "pageMappingStatus": "printed_labels_text_and_selected_rendered_pages_checked",
      "corroboratingSourceIds": [],
      "verificationStatus": "ai_source_comparison_only",
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "domainReviewed": false,
      "nativeReviewed": false
    },
    {
      "sectionId": "kaigo-atomic-standing-cane",
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "knowledgePointJa": "「上がるときは健側から」という足だけの覚え方では、杖の位置や介助者の位置まで説明できません。この文章は順序と理由を読み取る学習であり、未経験の介助を試す手順書ではありません。荷重や関節の状態が合わない人へ形を強制せず、不調や支えきれない状況では無理をせず応援や専門職の確認を求めます。",
      "evidenceType": "source_concept_independent_expression_with_conditions",
      "source": {
        "document": "介護ー特定技能ーベトナム語.pdf",
        "edition": "second revision March 2025",
        "sha256": "997bf386ba8344e19c644c3cbd6ae2d40760bfb32ed882db999ad8e17068aa54"
      },
      "printedPages": [
        129,
        132,
        133,
